t":false,"enableDrag":true,"enableDrop":true,"enableResize":{"top":false,"bottom":false,"left":false,"right":false},"selected":false,"useMinHeight":true,"visibility":{"desktop":true,"mobile":true},"style":{"desktop":{"background-color":"transparent","position":"static","margin-top":"-1px"},"mobile":{"top":"1020px","left":"0px"}},"data":{"component":null},"innerHtml":"","tagName":"SECTION"},{"id":"silex-id-1489143327626-2","pageNames":[],"classList":["website-width"],"type":"container-element","isSectionContent":true,"title":"","alt":null,"children":["silex-id-1440798996856-3","silex-id-1736780992358-0","silex-id-1440799193140-4","silex-id-1552778266502-3"],"link":null,"enableEdit":false,"enableDrag":false,"enableDrop":true,"enableResize":{"top":true,"bottom":true,"left":true,"right":true},"selected":false,"useMinHeight":true,"visibility":{"desktop":true,"mobile":true},"style":{"desktop":{"background-color":"transparent","height":"733px","position":"relative","margin-left":"auto","margin-right":"auto"},"mobile":{"height":"1014px"}},"data":{"component":null},"innerHtml":"","tagName":"DIV","attr":{"id":"after-hero"}},{"id":"silex-id-1440798996856-3","pageNames":[],"classList":[],"type":"text-element","isSectionContent":false,"title":"","alt":null,"children":[],"link":null,"enableEdit":true,"enableDrag":true,"enableDrop":false,"enableResize":{"top":true,"bottom":true,"left":true,"right":true},"selected":false,"useMinHeight":true,"visibility":{"desktop":true,"mobile":true},"style":{"desktop":{"width":"489px","top":"36px","left":"-70.5px","height":"94px","position":"absolute"},"mobile":{}},"data":{"component":null},"innerHtml":"\n                    <h2><b>A propos de moi</b></h2>\n                ","tagName":"DIV"},{"id":"silex-id-1440799193140-4","pageNames":[],"classList":["content-black"],"type":"text-element","isSectionContent":false,"title":"","alt":null,"children":[],"link":null,"enableEdit":true,"enableDrag":true,"enableDrop":false,"enableResize":{"top":true,"bottom":true,"left":true,"right":true},"selected":false,"useMinHeight":true,"visibility":{"desktop":true,"mobile":true},"style":{"desktop":{"width":"532px","top":"80.359375px","left":"398px","height":"445px","position":"absolute"},"mobile":{}},"data":{"component":null},"innerHtml":"\n                    <p>Passionnée par la communication et la gestion de projets, je suis actuellement en Master Information et Communication, Médias et Mondialisation à l’Université Paris Panthéon Assas. Avec une expérience riche et variée dans des domaines tels que la gestion des réseaux sociaux, la rédaction de contenu, et la réalisation de supports visuels, j’ai développé une forte aisance rédactionnelle et relationnelle. Curieuse et organisée, je m’investis pleinement dans chaque projet pour produire des résultats à la hauteur des attentes. Par ailleurs, ma sensibilité artistique et mon ouverture culturelle, nourries par des voyages, la pratique du piano et de la danse, enrichissent ma vision et ma créativité. Mon objectif : contribuer activement à des projets qui allient stratégie digitale et innovation.</p>\n                ","tagName":"DIV"},{"id":"silex-id-1489143411591-5","pageNames":[],"classList":[],"type":"section-element","isSectionContent":false,"title":"","alt":null,"children":["silex-id-1489143411591-4","silex-id-1736781710828-2"],"link":null,"enableEdit":false,"enableDrag":true,"enableDrop":true,"enableResize":{"top":false,"bottom":false,"left":false,"right":false},"selected":false,"useMinHeight":true,"visibility":{"desktop":true,"mobile":true},"style":{"desktop":{"background-color":"rgba(51,51,51,1)","background-image":"url(../../CamilleVallee/main/Nachtigal4.jpg)","position":"static","margin-top":"-1px"},"mobile":{}},"data":{"component":null},"innerHtml":"","tagName":"SECTION"},{"id":"silex-id-1489143411591-4","pageNames":[],"classList":["website-width"],"type":"container-element","isSectionContent":true,"title":"","alt":null,"children":["silex-id-1440800016088-6"],"link":null,"enableEdit":false,"enableDrag":false,"enableDrop":true,"enableResize":{"top":true,"bottom":true,"left":true,"right":true},"selected":false,"useMinHeight":true,"visibility":{"desktop":true,"mobile":true},"style":{"desktop":{"background-color":"transparent","height":"960px","position":"relative","margin-left":"auto","margin-right":"auto"},"mobile":{}},"data":{"component":null},"innerHtml":"","tagName":"DIV"},{"id":"silex-id-1440800016088-6","pageNames":[],"classList":["middle-text","content-white"],"type":"text-element","isSectionContent":false,"title":"","alt":null,"children":[],"link":null,"enableEdit":true,"enableDrag":true,"enableDrop":false,"enableResize":{"top":true,"bottom":true,"left":true,"right":true},"selected":false,"useMinHeight":true,"visibility":{"desktop":true,"mobile":true},"style":{"desktop":{"width":"960px","top":"134px","left":"0px","height":"621px","position":"absolute","background-color":"rgba(51,51,51,1)"},"mobile":{}},"data":{"component":null},"innerHtml":"\n\n<h3><b>Chargée de Communication Digitale à la Direction Internationale d'EDF</b></h3><p>En tant que Chargée de Communication Digitale à la Direction Internationale d'EDF, j'ai la responsabilité de garantir une communication fluide et cohérente entre les équipes locales présentes dans les différents pays et celles basées en France. Mon rôle principal est d'assurer la gestion et l'animation des contenus numériques sur nos différents sites internet internationaux, en lien avec les priorités et les besoins locaux.</p><p>Je m'occupe de la rédaction et de la mise en ligne d'articles, en veillant à leur pertinence et à leur adéquation avec les enjeux d'EDF à l'international. Je m'assure également de l’optimisation et de la mise à jour régulière de ces contenus pour garantir leur efficacité et leur visibilité.</p><p>En parallèle, je gère le suivi du bon fonctionnement des sites, en rédigeant des rapports détaillant les performances et en proposant des améliorations continues. Mon rôle implique aussi la formation des équipes locales aux bonnes pratiques de la communication digitale, pour garantir une utilisation optimale des outils et supports numériques.</p><p>En lien constant avec les équipes locales et les équipes en France, je fais le lien entre les différents acteurs afin de faciliter les échanges d'informations et promouvoir une communication unifiée au sein du groupe EDF.</p>\n\n","tagName":"DIV"},{"id":"silex-id-1489143528708-7","pageNames":[],"classList":[],"type":"section-element","isSectionContent":false,"title":"","alt":null,"children":["silex-id-1552777983097-1","silex-id-1489143528708-6"],"link":null,"enableEdit":false,"enableDrag":true,"enableDrop":true,"enableResize":{"top":false,"bottom":false,"left":false,"right":false},"selected":false,"useMinHeight":true,"visibility":{"desktop":true,"mobile":true},"style":{"desktop":{"position":"static","margin-top":"-1px"},"mobile":{"top":"6167px","left":"0px"}},"data":{"component":null},"innerHtml":"","tagName":"DIV"},{"id":"silex-id-1489143528708-6","pageNames":[],"classList":["website-width"],"type":"container-element","isSectionContent":true,"title":"","alt":null,"children":["silex-id-1440801309675-13","silex-id-1492792986749-1","silex-id-1736781599219-1"],"link":null,"enableEdit":false,"enableDrag":false,"enableDrop":true,"enableResize":{"top":true,"bottom":true,"left":true,"right":true},"selected":false,"useMinHeight":true,"visibility":{"desktop":true,"mobile":true},"style":{"desktop":{"background-color":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","height":"1163px","position":"relative","margin-left":"auto","margin-right":"auto"},"mobile":{"height":"472px"}},"data":{"component":null},"innerHtml":"","tagName":"DIV","attr":{"id":"menu"}},{"id":"silex-id-1440801309675-13","pageNames":["page-code"],"classList":["col","content-columns"],"type":"text-element","isSectionContent":false,"title":"","alt":null,"children":[],"link":null,"enableEdit":true,"enableDrag":true,"enableDrop":false,"enableResize":{"top":true,"bottom"